# SOP Lang of the 13 quick examples ("Send one sentence", docs/js/ui.js QUICK), in the order of the menu.
# Generation model: Claude Opus 5.5 (claude-opus-5-5), 2026-11-04. Format and rules: CONVENTIONS.md.
# Each one is sent on its own against whatever drawing is open; they name the shapes of the opening drawing (Start, Process, Check, Done).

## turn 1
# input: Draw a small pink star next to Done
@c1 command action=create shape=star size=small color=pink position=near anchor=Done

## turn 2
# input: Make the green circle bigger
@m1 mention shape=circle color=green
@c1 command action=resize target=$m1

## turn 3
# input: Connect Done to Start with a dotted line
@c1 command action=connect from=Done to=Start style=dotted arrow=none

## turn 4
# input: Is there a path from Start to Done?
@q1 question ask=path from=Start to=Done

## turn 5
# input: What is connected to Check?
@q1 question ask=neighbors target=Check

## turn 6
# input: Add three tiny red circles in a row below Process
@c1 command action=create count=3 shape=circle size=tiny color=red position=below anchor=Process layout=row

## turn 7
# input: Which shape has the most connections?
#! scope: every shape of the canvas, not only the current area
@q1 question ask=extreme superlative=mostConnected shape=any

## turn 8
# input: From now on, circles are orange
@r1 rule shape=circle color=orange

## turn 9
# input: Check is above Process
@f1 fact target=Check position=above anchor=Process

## turn 10
# input: Rename Done to End
@c1 command action=rename target=Done name=End

## turn 11
# input: Arrange everything in a circle
@c1 command action=arrange layout=circle

## turn 12
# input: Describe the diagram
#! scope: describes every shape of the canvas, not only the current area
@q1 question ask=describe

## turn 13
# input: @g1 command action=create shape=star color=gold name=Gem position=center
#! direct: already SOP Lang in docs/js/ui.js QUICK since e69eef6 (2026-11-03), the first commit of this repository; written by hand, not by the generation model; played as written
@g1 command action=create shape=star color=gold name=Gem position=center
